    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but it's a bit too brief. Could you expand it? Maybe include a section on the specific physical symptoms people might feel if they aren't sitting right, like tension or those annoying little aches that pop up during the day. We want them to realize the risks before it becomes a real problem.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
